  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Mitigation and Preparedness in Action II (IMPACT II) The Federated States of Micronesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Inclusive Mitigation and Preparedness in Action II (IMPACT II) project is for government and communities to demonstrate strengthened resilience and adaptive capacity in the context of climate change and natural hazards.  The proposed project will work at the individual community level, as well as the state level, to enhance coordination between community, NGO and government partners.</narrative>
  </description>
